\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 **Galactic Environmental and Life Protection Agency (GELPA)**\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 The Galactic Environmental and Life Protection Agency (GELPA) is an essential body within The Convergence, charged with the monumental task of enforcing the Galactic Life Preservation Act and other environmental regulations across the vast expanse of the human sphere.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 In the spirit of the old Earth balance scales, GELPA's logo features a stylized image of a scale, symbolizing the delicate balance of life and the agency's role in preserving it. One side of the scale holds a planet, representing the ecosystems that GELPA is tasked with protecting. The other side holds a cluster of stars, symbolizing the wider universe and humanity's responsibility towards it.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 GELPA operates with a degree of autonomy, reporting directly to the Interstellar Council but carrying out its duties without interference from other bodies or interests. It maintains a fleet of enforcement vessels and employs a diverse staff of scientists, law enforcement officials, and diplomats. Its responsibilities include monitoring ecosystems, investigating breaches of environmental law, educating the public about environmental stewardship, and implementing restoration efforts where damage has occurred.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Both respected and feared, GELPA is a constant reminder of humanity's collective responsibility to life and the environment. It embodies a shift in perspective from the destructive practices of old Earth to a future where humans live in harmony with the universe.\cb1 \
}